<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#sadness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The dog's facial expression, characterized by large, droopy eyes with visible tear, a slightly downturned mouth, and a generally melancholic appearance, conveys a strong sense of sadness. This is amplified by the tight framing on the dog's face, which emphasizes its emotive features."@en .
