<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#abortion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The medical procedure to terminate a pregnancy. This is a real-world concept and a sensitive, often controversial, topic. The text references abortion, which is a real-world event and concept that is central to the meme's scenario."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semanticallyAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates semantic-based adjacency between dimension instances"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#stereotype_of_sad_dog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The use of a dog's sad expression as a visual metaphor for human emotional distress. This is a common trope in internet memes and visual culture, where animals are anthropomorphized to convey human emotions. The dog's expression is used to amplify the perceived tragedy of the scenario, which relies on this cultural stereotype."@en .
