<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#dog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A close-up of a black and white Boston Terrier with a sad, tearful expression, featuring large, expressive brown eyes and a slightly open mouth revealing pink gums and dark spots. The dog's fur is short and smooth, with distinct black and white markings, including a white stripe running down the center of its face. The image is framed tightly around the dog's head and upper muzzle, emphasizing its emotive facial features."@en .
