<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#reproductive_healthcare> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A broad category of medical services related to reproductive health, including contraception, pregnancy testing, and abortion. The text references an abortion clinic, which falls under this category. Understanding this concept is necessary to interpret the context of the scenario described in the meme."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#reproductive_healthcare> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#relatedTo> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#text_chunk> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#assertion_about_01256> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#asserts> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#trivialization_of_medical_procedure> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#financial_failure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The inability to complete a financial transaction, such as a payment being declined. This is a real-world concept that is central to the meme's premise. The text describes a situation where the debit card declines, which is a common occurrence in real life and is used to set up the absurd consequence."@en .
