<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the experience described in the text overlay: 'when your debit card decline at the abortion clinic and they have to put the baby back in.' The use of 'your' explicitly directs the user to identify with the person experiencing the financial failure at the abortion clinic. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the viewer is positioned as the subject of the scenario, making the dark humor personal and immediate."@en .
