<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#abortion_clinic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical facility that provides abortion services. The term is used in the text to refer to a specific type of healthcare provider, which is a real-world entity and concept. Understanding the context of abortion clinics is necessary to interpret the scenario described in the meme, which involves a financial transaction at such a facility."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#contextuallyReferentAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:n2cca5ee77daa4f4080c9d2ef8b903161b13 .
