<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Value> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#sad_dog_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A close-up scene of a Boston Terrier dog with a sad, tearful expression, featuring large, expressive brown eyes and a slightly open mouth revealing pink gums and dark spots. The dog's fur is short and smooth, with distinct black and white markings, including a white stripe running down the center of its face. The image is framed tightly around the dog's head and upper muzzle, emphasizing its emotive facial features. The scene is overlaid with text that reads: 'when your debit card decline at the abortion clinic' and 'and they have to put the baby back in.'"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Outlined-stroked> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#DirectSuperimposition> .
