<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01256#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The target community for this meme is individuals who are familiar with internet dark humor tropes, particularly those who understand the use of anthropomorphized animals (like the sad dog) to convey human emotional states in absurd or morbid contexts. The meme is likely intended for an online audience that appreciates or engages with edgy, provocative, and potentially offensive humor that juxtaposes everyday financial mishaps with extreme, grotesque consequences. This audience may also be familiar with reproductive healthcare issues and the financial barriers associated with them, though the meme’s intent is to trivialize these serious topics. The target community may include users of meme-sharing platforms who are accustomed to dark humor and may not perceive the content as harmful, despite its potential to offend or distress others."@en .
